{"segment_id": "segment_00014", "start": 420.0, "end": 450.0, "speech": "章老习惯，熟读成诵，给自己讲解一遍今天的核心知识点。那如果大家喜欢我们的课程，欢迎大家关注、订阅、一键三连、分享给那些需要的朋友，来帮助我们快速成长。最后呢，我们看一句名人名言：Peace is not absence of conflict. It is the ability to handle conflict by peaceful means. See you next time.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000047.webp", "time": 425.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划"], "scores": [0.98997], "boxes": [[[1497.0, 50.0], [1739.0, 50.0], [1739.0, 96.0], [1497.0, 96.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000048.webp", "time": 434.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Peace is not absence of conflict, it is the", "ability to handle conflict by peaceful", "means.", "Ronald Reagan"], "scores": [0.97296, 0.98806, 0.99911, 0.98452], "boxes": [[[71.0, 659.0], [971.0, 661.0], [971.0, 720.0], [71.0, 718.0]], [[69.0, 722.0], [899.0, 718.0], [899.0, 784.0], [69.0, 788.0]], [[73.0, 796.0], [242.0, 798.0], [242.0, 839.0], [73.0, 837.0]], [[759.0, 841.0], [1049.0, 848.0], [1048.0, 898.0], [758.0, 891.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
